Print version, commit, build date and the built in limits

Usage:
  onesie version [flags]

Flags:
  -h, --help            help for version
  -o, --output string   json prints the same as one JSON object

Global Flags:
      --profile string    The profile a run uses, from profiles.json in the config dir. Overrides ONESIE_PROFILE and ONESIE_PROVIDER. Otherwise the default profile runs, which onesie profile use sets.
      --provider string   Run on this provider without a profile: typesafe, openrouter, berget, levanto or cloudflare. Overrides ONESIE_PROVIDER and the default profile. Refused beside --profile or ONESIE_PROFILE.
